0..58 Comment "// This source probes reflexivity forms for category laws."
59..61 Comment "//"
62..136 Comment "// The probes cover variables, functions, applications and integer-indexed"
137..194 Comment "// families. They model a hom-set indexed by its objects."
195..197 Comment "//"
198..248 Comment "// `cat-shape.gandr` uses each probe in isolation."
249..307 Comment "// Each probe is a reflexivity of the HoTT book\'s § 1.12."
308..310 Comment "//"
311..334 Comment "// - cites: [HoTT-Book]"
335..337 Comment "//"
338..486 Comment "// [HoTT-Book]: https://homotopytypetheory.org/book/ \"The Univalent Foundations Program, Homotopy Type Theory: Univalent Foundations of Mathematics\""
